            HtmlContent: @"
                <p>Upuaut is a Windows desktop application with a WPF host and a Blazor Hybrid interface rendered in WebView2. The interface calls the application's .NET services in-process, while Windows event logs and packet capture use the operating-system APIs available to the current capture mode.</p>
                
                <h4>The Upuaut In-Process Philosophy</h4>
                <p>Upuaut runs <strong>Microsoft Blazor Hybrid with WPF and WebView2</strong> on <strong>.NET 10</strong>. Razor components execute in the .NET desktop process; WebView2 renders the UI. This is not Blazor WebAssembly.</p>
