                <h4>2. Launch Profiles &amp; Elevated Debugging</h4>
                <p><code>launchSettings.json</code> in <code>Upuaut.App/Properties</code> contains two distinct F5 launch profiles:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Upuaut.App (Standard):</strong> Runs under the current user account for UI development and offline .evtx analysis.</li>
                    <li><strong>Upuaut.App (Elevated Administrator):</strong> Launches with elevated privileges to test live raw socket packet capture and Windows Security logs.</li>
